["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>A short hunt can turn into a night out. The right pack keeps you alive. The right car kit gets you and the meat home.</p></aside>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AdventureSmart's Three Ts: Trip planning, leave a plan with someone. Training, know how to use your gear. Taking the essentials, the 10 essentials every time.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The Three Ts</text>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"120\" height=\"236\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <rect x=\"140\" y=\"44\" width=\"120\" height=\"236\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <rect x=\"270\" y=\"44\" width=\"120\" height=\"236\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"80\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">T</text>\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"80\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">T</text>\n    <circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"80\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">T</text>\n    <text x=\"70\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Trip</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"148\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">planning</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Training</text>\n    <text x=\"330\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Taking the</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"148\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">essentials</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- icons -->\n  <rect x=\"46\" y=\"170\" width=\"48\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"54\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"186\"/><line x1=\"54\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"198\"/><line x1=\"54\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"210\"/></g>\n  <path d=\"M176 210 l24 -30 l24 30 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M190 214 h20\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <path d=\"M306 180 h48 v54 h-48 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M314 180 q16 -18 32 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"70\" y=\"256\">Leave a plan</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"256\">Know your gear</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"256\">10 essentials</text></g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Carry the <strong>10 essentials</strong> every time, even for 2 hours <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Leave a <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Trip plan\">Trip plan</button> with someone who will call for help <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full key points</summary><ul><li>AdventureSmart's Three Ts: <strong>Trip planning, Training, Taking the essentials</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Carry the <strong>10 essentials</strong> every time, even for a 2 hour hunt <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Add hunting extras: tourniquet, knife, game bags, rope (Tip).</li><li>Leave a trip plan with someone who will call for help if you are late <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>A <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Satellite messenger\">Satellite messenger</button> works where your phone has no signal <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li><li>Plan the meat: cooler, ice, and a way to keep it dry (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AdventureSmart's 10 essentials as icons: 1 light, 2 fire kit, 3 whistle or mirror, 4 extra food and water, 5 extra clothing, 6 map and compass, 7 first aid kit, 8 emergency shelter, 9 pocket knife, 10 sun protection.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The 10 essentials</text>\n  <g fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n    <rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"85\" y=\"34\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"164\" y=\"34\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"243\" y=\"34\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"322\" y=\"34\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/>\n    <rect x=\"6\" y=\"166\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"85\" y=\"166\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"164\" y=\"166\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"243\" y=\"166\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"322\" y=\"166\" width=\"74\" height=\"124\" rx=\"8\"/>\n  </g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">\n    <text x=\"12\" y=\"52\">1</text><text x=\"91\" y=\"52\">2</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"52\">3</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"52\">4</text><text x=\"328\" y=\"52\">5</text>\n    <text x=\"12\" y=\"184\">6</text><text x=\"91\" y=\"184\">7</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"184\">8</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"184\">9</text><text x=\"328\" y=\"184\">10</text>\n  </g>\n  <!-- 1 headlamp -->\n  <path d=\"M24 92 q19 -26 38 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"78\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><path d=\"M52 82 l14 -8 v24 Z\" fill=\"#e8b10c\"/>\n  <!-- 2 fire -->\n  <path d=\"M122 106 q-20 -18 0 -44 q4 18 12 20 q8 12 -12 24 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <!-- 3 whistle -->\n  <rect x=\"180\" y=\"78\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"74\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <!-- 4 food water -->\n  <rect x=\"258\" y=\"66\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><rect x=\"280\" y=\"80\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n  <!-- 5 clothing -->\n  <path d=\"M340 70 l10 -6 h14 l10 6 l8 18 l-8 4 v18 h-34 v-18 l-8 -4 Z\" fill=\"#6b6f48\"/>\n  <!-- 6 map compass -->\n  <rect x=\"16\" y=\"210\" width=\"34\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"236\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M58 224 l4 12 h-8 Z\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n  <!-- 7 first aid -->\n  <rect x=\"100\" y=\"208\" width=\"44\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><path d=\"M122 214 v28 M108 228 h28\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n  <!-- 8 shelter -->\n  <path d=\"M174 252 L201 206 L228 252 Z\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- 9 knife -->\n  <path d=\"M254 238 L292 220 L298 224 L262 244 Z\" fill=\"#8a8f88\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"246\" y=\"238\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" transform=\"rotate(-25 255 243)\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\"/>\n  <!-- 10 sun -->\n  <circle cx=\"359\" cy=\"230\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e8b10c\"/><g stroke=\"#e8b10c\" stroke-width=\"3\"><line x1=\"359\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"212\"/><line x1=\"359\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"359\" y2=\"254\"/><line x1=\"335\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"341\" y2=\"230\"/><line x1=\"377\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"383\" y2=\"230\"/></g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"43\" y=\"132\">Light</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"132\">Fire kit</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"132\">Whistle</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"126\">Food,</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"144\">water</text><text x=\"359\" y=\"126\">Extra</text><text x=\"359\" y=\"144\">layers</text>\n    <text x=\"43\" y=\"276\">Map</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"270\">First</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"286\">aid</text><text x=\"201\" y=\"276\">Shelter</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"276\">Knife</text><text x=\"359\" y=\"276\">Sun</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Add for hunting: tourniquet, knife, game bags, rope (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the list in words</summary><ol><li>Flashlight or headlamp, spare batteries <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Fire making kit: waterproof matches or lighter, fire starter <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Signalling device: whistle or mirror <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Extra food and water <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Extra clothing: rain and wind gear, toque <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Navigation and communication aids: map, compass <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>First aid kit, and know how to use it <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Emergency shelter: blanket or tarp <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Pocket knife <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li><li>Sun protection: glasses, sunscreen, hat <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">75%</span>.</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tourniquet on an arm. Use it for life threatening bleeding from a limb when firm pressure fails. Put it a few centimetres above the wound, between the wound and the heart, never on a joint. Tighten until the bleeding stops and write down the time.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Tourniquet: where it goes</text>\n  <!-- arm -->\n  <path d=\"M20 120 L180 110 Q 200 108 210 120 L380 126 L380 176 L210 170 Q 200 182 180 180 L20 180 Z\" fill=\"#d9b48f\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Heart side</text>\n  <!-- elbow -->\n  <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"146\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not on a joint</text>\n  <!-- wound -->\n  <ellipse cx=\"320\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"14\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n  <text x=\"340\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Wound</text>\n  <!-- tourniquet -->\n  <rect x=\"262\" y=\"120\" width=\"18\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"250\" y=\"104\" width=\"42\" height=\"10\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <line x1=\"271\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"271\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <text x=\"271\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Above the wound</text>\n  <path d=\"M282 196 L308 196\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M286 190 l-6 6 l6 6 M304 190 l6 6 l-6 6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <!-- clock -->\n  <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"248\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M70 248 V232 M70 248 h12\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <text x=\"104\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Tighten until bleeding stops.</text>\n  <text x=\"104\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Write the time.</text>\n  <text x=\"104\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Firm pressure first</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li><button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Tourniquet\">Tourniquet</button> in the <strong>same pocket</strong> every hunt (Tip). Place it 5 to 8 cm (2 to 3 in) above the wound <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Take a course with tourniquet practice (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: when, how, and fakes</summary><ul><li>A firearm or knife accident can bleed out fast. Carry a tourniquet in the same pocket every hunt (Tip).</li><li>Use one for life threatening bleeding from an arm or leg that pressure does not stop <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Place it 5 to 8 cm (2 to 3 in) above the wound, not on a joint <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Tighten until the bleeding stops. Note the time. Leave it on until help arrives <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>CAT (Combat Application Tourniquet) Gen 7: $52 to $59.99 CAD (Canadian dollars). Price checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>.</li><li>Counterfeits exist. A CAT under about $32 is probably fake. Buy from a known medical seller <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span>.</li><li>Take a first aid course with tourniquet practice. Owning one is not knowing how (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Entry</th><th>Mid</th><th>Premium</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Knife</td><td>Morakniv Companion, $27.99 to $34.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Havalon Piranta, $59.98 to $99.98 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr><tr><td>Game bags</td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td><td>Caribou Gear Muley set (4 quarter bags + 1 parts bag), $94.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr><tr><td>Satellite messenger</td><td>Garmin inReach Mini 2, $349.99 sale to $489.99 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></td><td>Garmin inReach Messenger Plus, $569.99 sale <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></td><td><span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul><li>About 15 m of strong cord to hang quarters or drag a deer (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: notes and price check</summary><ul><li><strong>Knife:</strong> one fixed blade plus a replaceable blade knife (Tip).</li><li><strong>Rope:</strong> about 15 m of strong cord to hang quarters or drag a deer (Tip).</li><li>Game bags let meat breathe and keep flies and dirt off (Tip).</li><li>Satellite messengers need a paid plan. Plan cost: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span>.</li><li>Price checked 2026-10-01. Search preview prices, verify at checkout.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 320\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Day pack layout, what goes where. Lid: headlamp, map, compass, licences in a zip bag. Top of main bag: rain shell, extra layer, toque. Middle: food, water, first aid kit. Bottom: game bags, rope, emergency blanket. Side pocket: water bottle. Hip belt: tourniquet on one side, whistle and bear spray on the other. Shoulder strap: satellite messenger.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Day pack: what goes where (Tip)</text>\n  <!-- pack -->\n  <path d=\"M120 40 Q 200 26 280 40 L284 80 L116 80 Z\" fill=\"#6b6f48\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"116\" y=\"80\" width=\"168\" height=\"200\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"122\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"146\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n  <line x1=\"122\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"278\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/>\n  <rect x=\"96\" y=\"150\" width=\"22\" height=\"70\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#6b6f48\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"140\" width=\"14\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/>\n  <rect x=\"60\" y=\"272\" width=\"280\" height=\"22\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"70\" y=\"276\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><rect x=\"296\" y=\"276\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c9a227\"/>\n  <rect x=\"268\" y=\"56\" width=\"10\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#5c5a4a\"/><rect x=\"264\" y=\"92\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"64\">Lid</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"108\">Rain shell</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"126\">extra layer, toque</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"176\">Food, water</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"194\">first aid kit</text>\n    <text x=\"200\" y=\"240\">Game bags, rope</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"258\">emergency blanket</text>\n  </g>\n  <g stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"50\"/><line x1=\"102\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"140\"/><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"304\"/><line x1=\"314\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"304\"/><line x1=\"282\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"90\"/></g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"4\" y=\"46\">Headlamp,</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"62\" font-weight=\"normal\">map, compass,</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"78\" font-weight=\"normal\">licences</text>\n    <text x=\"4\" y=\"126\">Water</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"142\" font-weight=\"normal\">bottle</text>\n    <text x=\"10\" y=\"316\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Tourniquet</text>\n    <text x=\"310\" y=\"84\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Satellite</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#e8590c\">messenger</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">Whistle, spray</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Same spot every time. You find it in the dark (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: headlamp, fire, navigation</summary><ul><li><strong>Headlamp:</strong> you have one. Add spare batteries and a small backup light (Tip).</li><li><strong>Fire:</strong> lighter plus waterproof matches plus fire starter cubes. Three ways (Tip).<ul><li>Check fire bans before every trip: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> with BC Wildfire Service.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Navigation:</strong> phone with offline maps, plus paper map and compass as backup (Tip).<ul><li>Download the map area at home on Wi Fi. Phone batteries die in cold. Carry a power bank (Tip).</li></ul></li><li><strong>Satellite messenger:</strong> send an SOS (emergency call for help) and texts with no cell signal <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"pack-day\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:0\"><span>Tourniquet in the same pocket every time</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:1\"><span>First aid kit</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:2\"><span>Headlamp plus spare batteries</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:3\"><span>Lighter, waterproof matches, fire starter</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:4\"><span>Whistle</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:5\"><span>Extra food and 1 L water or more</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:6\"><span>Extra layer, rain shell, toque, spare gloves</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:7\"><span>Phone with offline map, power bank</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:8\"><span>Paper map and compass</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:9\"><span>Satellite messenger, charged, plan active</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:10\"><span>Emergency blanket or small tarp</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:11\"><span>Knife, spare blades</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:12\"><span>Game bags and 15 m of rope</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:13\"><span>Sunglasses, sunscreen</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:14\"><span>Licences, tags, photo ID, PAL (Possession and Acquisition Licence) in a zip bag</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:15\"><span>Ammo for this hunt only (correct load)</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:16\"><span>Blaze orange vest and toque</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-day:17\"><span>Trip plan left with someone</span></label></div>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Car kit grid: winter tires for the route, spare tire and jack, shovel, tow strap, booster cables or jump pack, full fuel tank, spare dry clothes and boots, coolers with block ice, firearm case and lock.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Car kit</text>\n  <g fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n    <rect x=\"6\" y=\"32\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"137\" y=\"32\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"32\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/>\n    <rect x=\"6\" y=\"122\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"137\" y=\"122\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"122\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/>\n    <rect x=\"6\" y=\"212\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"137\" y=\"212\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/><rect x=\"268\" y=\"212\" width=\"126\" height=\"84\" rx=\"8\"/>\n  </g>\n  <!-- icons -->\n  <circle cx=\"69\" cy=\"62\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"69\" cy=\"62\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a8f88\"/><g stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M53 50 l6 4 M49 62 h7 M53 74 l6 -4\"/></g>\n  <circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"62\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"62\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a8f88\"/><path d=\"M214 80 l20 -30 l8 4 l-20 30 Z\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M330 44 v30\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M318 74 h24 l-4 16 h-16 Z\" fill=\"#8a8f88\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M40 152 q30 -16 60 0 q-30 16 -60 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"146\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M170 140 q20 40 40 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M180 140 q20 40 40 0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <rect x=\"314\" y=\"134\" width=\"32\" height=\"40\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><rect x=\"322\" y=\"128\" width=\"16\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"330\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">F</text>\n  <path d=\"M46 236 l12 -8 h22 l12 8 l6 16 l-8 4 v12 h-40 v-12 l-8 -4 Z\" fill=\"#6b6f48\"/>\n  <rect x=\"166\" y=\"230\" width=\"68\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\"/><rect x=\"166\" y=\"230\" width=\"68\" height=\"10\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"246\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"246\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"290\" y=\"236\" width=\"82\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"322\" y=\"228\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"324\" y=\"238\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n    <text x=\"69\" y=\"106\">Winter tires</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"106\">Spare, jack</text><text x=\"331\" y=\"106\">Shovel</text>\n    <text x=\"69\" y=\"196\">Tow strap</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"196\">Boosters</text><text x=\"331\" y=\"196\">Full fuel</text>\n    <text x=\"69\" y=\"286\">Dry clothes</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"286\">Coolers, ice</text><text x=\"331\" y=\"286\">Gun case, lock</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Winter tires on many BC highways from 1 October <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>. Check DriveBC.</li></ul><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Firearm in a vehicle. Unloaded means no cartridge in the chamber and none in an attached or inserted magazine. Magazine out, chamber empty, before it goes in the car or on the ATV. Vehicle left alone: firearm locked in the trunk, or out of sight with the vehicle locked.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guns in the car: unloaded</text>\n  <!-- rifle -->\n  <path d=\"M20 80 L110 74 L118 74 L126 96 L200 94 L200 102 L120 106 L104 114 L92 108 L20 122 Z\" fill=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"110\" y=\"66\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#6b6f68\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"190\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#6b6f68\"/>\n  <rect x=\"126\" y=\"68\" width=\"30\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"128\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M152 112 v12\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M146 118 l6 8 l6 -8\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><text x=\"176\" y=\"140\">Magazine out</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"160\">Chamber empty</text></g>\n  <text x=\"140\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Look: empty</text>\n  <!-- car -->\n  <path d=\"M20 250 L20 220 L60 216 L90 190 L190 190 L220 216 L290 220 L300 250 Z\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"252\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"252\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <rect x=\"226\" y=\"222\" width=\"62\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"232\" y=\"226\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#6b4f35\"/>\n  <rect x=\"270\" y=\"196\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"266\" y=\"206\" width=\"24\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><text x=\"310\" y=\"214\">Left alone?</text></g>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"><text x=\"310\" y=\"234\">Locked trunk</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"252\">No trunk:</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"270\">hidden, locked</text></g>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">An ATV counts as a vehicle too</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: roads, ATV and firearm transport</summary><ul><li>Many BC highways need winter tires (M+S, mud and snow, or mountain snowflake symbol, 3.5 mm tread) from 1 October <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span>. Check your route on DriveBC.</li><li>Gravel <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"FSR\">FSR</button> (Forest Service Road) trips: spare tire, jack, and know how to change it (Tip).</li><li>Shovel, tow strap, booster cables or jump pack (Tip).</li><li>Spare dry clothes and boots in a dry bag (Tip).</li><li>Full fuel tank before leaving pavement (Tip).</li><li><button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ATV\">ATV</button> (all terrain vehicle): helmet, tool kit, tow rope. ATV rules on Crown land and roads: <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> (<button class=\"term\" data-term=\"ORV\">ORV</button> Act, Off Road Vehicle Act).</li><li>Firearm transport: every gun <strong>unloaded</strong>, nothing in the chamber or in an attached magazine <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Assumption: your guns are non restricted.</li><li>Vehicle left unattended (no adult or firearms licence holder with it): gun in the locked trunk. No trunk: out of sight, vehicle locked <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li><li>BC: no loaded gun in or on any motor vehicle, and an ATV counts <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cooler cut open. Block ice or frozen jugs at the bottom with a rack above. Meat in game bags sits on the rack, dry, above the meltwater. The drain is open so water runs out. Pre chill the cooler the night before.\">\n  <rect width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Meat cold and dry</text>\n  <rect x=\"40\" y=\"56\" width=\"260\" height=\"190\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n  <rect x=\"54\" y=\"70\" width=\"232\" height=\"164\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n  <rect x=\"34\" y=\"44\" width=\"272\" height=\"16\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <rect x=\"54\" y=\"214\" width=\"232\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\" opacity=\".4\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#dfe6d3\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"62\" y=\"186\" width=\"50\" height=\"34\"/><rect x=\"122\" y=\"186\" width=\"50\" height=\"34\"/><rect x=\"182\" y=\"186\" width=\"50\" height=\"34\"/><rect x=\"242\" y=\"186\" width=\"38\" height=\"34\"/></g>\n  <line x1=\"56\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"284\" y2=\"178\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-dasharray=\"14 6\"/>\n  <g fill=\"#f4e6d6\" stroke=\"#8b5a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"146\" rx=\"44\" ry=\"26\"/><ellipse cx=\"220\" cy=\"146\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"28\"/></g>\n  <rect x=\"290\" y=\"222\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n  <path d=\"M312 230 q10 10 6 30\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\"/>\n  <g font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">\n    <text x=\"160\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Game bags of meat</text>\n    <text x=\"310\" y=\"180\">Rack</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"206\">Block ice</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"294\" fill=\"#4a7fb0\">Drain open</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"276\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\">Never in meltwater</text>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"294\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\">Pre chill the night before</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Cool meat fast. Bacteria grow quickly above about 4 °C (40 °F) <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li></ul><ul><li>Block ice, a rack, drain open. Meat <strong>dry</strong> <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full cooler plan</summary><ul><li>Cool meat fast. Bacteria grow quickly above about 4 °C (40 °F) <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Skin and quarter soon after the kill when you can. Hide holds heat <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Pre chill the cooler the night before <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Use <strong>block ice</strong> or frozen water jugs. They last longer than cubes <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Keep meat <strong>dry</strong>: game bags on a rack or bag ice, never in meltwater. Open the drain <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span>.</li><li>Cold Interior day? Hang quarters in shade and let air move round them (Tip).</li><li>Assumption: one deer in quarters fits in about 2 large coolers. <span class=\"verify\">VERIFY</span> with your coolers at home.</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"checklist\" data-list=\"pack-car\"><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:0\"><span>Winter tires or chains for the route</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:1\"><span>Spare tire, jack, lug wrench</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:2\"><span>Shovel and tow strap</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:3\"><span>Booster cables or jump pack</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:4\"><span>Full fuel tank</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:5\"><span>Spare dry clothes and boots</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:6\"><span>Extra water and food</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:7\"><span>Coolers, pre chilled</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:8\"><span>Block ice or frozen water jugs</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:9\"><span>Rack or grate for the cooler bottom</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:10\"><span>Tarp for the truck bed or trunk</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:11\"><span>Extra game bags and rope</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:12\"><span>Firearm case and lock</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:13\"><span>Paper map of the area</span></label><label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-key=\"pack-car:14\"><span>ATV: helmet, tools, tow rope, fuel</span></label></div>","<aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Pack it like you will sleep out tonight. One day you will.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>First aid kit left in the truck \"for a short walk\".</li><li>No trip plan. Nobody knows where to look.</li><li>Meat in cooler meltwater on the drive home.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Pack the day pack tonight. Unpack it and say what each item is for. If you can't, learn it or leave it.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Firearm transport read directly in federal and BC law (90 to 99%). Gear, first aid and meat care: secondary sources (60 to 75%).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.adventuresmart.ca/the-three-ts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AdventureSmart: The Three Ts</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (75%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://old.adventuresmart.ca/land/survive-essentials.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AdventureSmart 10 essentials</a>, checked 2026-10-01 (75%, search preview)</li><li><a href=\"https://health.osu.edu/health/general-health/tourniquet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ohio State Health: stopping a bleed and using a tourniquet</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://bushlife.ca/cat-tourniquet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Bushlife: CAT tourniquet and counterfeits in Canada</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">60%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/british-columbia/winter-tires-required-most-highways-october-1-1.7338165\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CBC: winter tires required on most BC highways from 1 October</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">70%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://idfg.idaho.gov/press/warm-weather-means-hunters-should-take-precautions-game-meat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Idaho Fish and Game: warm weather and game meat</a>, checked 2026-10-01 <span class=\"cert c-lo\" title=\"Certainty\">65%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/regulations/SOR-98-209/FullText.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Storage, Display, Transportation and Handling of Firearms by Individuals Regulations, SOR/98-209</a>, read directly, current to 2026-09-21: s. 1 (unloaded, unattended), s. 10 (transport of non restricted firearms). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly. Printed p. 4 (motor vehicle includes an ATV), p. 11 (It's Unlawful 27, loaded firearm in or on a vehicle). Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.bclaws.gov.bc.ca/civix/document/id/complete/statreg/21007\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firearm Violence Prevention Act, SBC 2021 c. 7</a>, s. 4(1): no loaded firearm in or on a vehicle or boat. Read in the Bill 4, 2021 third reading text. The BC Laws Table of Legislative Changes lists ss. 1 to 4 in force 1 October 2026. Checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span></li><li>Prices: search previews of Canadian retailer pages (Best Buy, MEC, Sail, Deakin, The Trip Shed, Bass Pro Canada, Mountain Man Outdoors, Jim Bow's Archery, 911supply), price checked 2026-10-01 (60 to 65%)</li></ul></details>"]